WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.031 --> 00:00:03.309
"This place is going to blow up!" Roxy cried.

2
00:00:03.310 --> 00:00:05.289
"We have to get out of here!"

3
00:00:05.290 --> 00:00:08.381
Terrell looked around. "Where's Bippo?"

4
00:00:08.382 --> 00:00:12.313
Cozlin dashed all around the room, looking for the tiny robot.

5
00:00:12.314 --> 00:00:15.551
"I don't see him. Maybe he flew out of here."

6
00:00:15.552 --> 00:00:19.932
Wukong shrugged. "He was probably scared of that big robot."

7
00:00:19.933 --> 00:00:22.774
Just then they heard shouts from the stadium crowd.

8
00:00:22.775 --> 00:00:25.368
It sounded like everyone was arguing.

9
00:00:25.369 --> 00:00:29.808
"There's no way that huge crowd can evacuate quickly," Roxy said.

10
00:00:29.809 --> 00:00:32.572
"We need to help."

11
00:00:32.573 --> 00:00:38.854
They hurried back into the arena, where fighters and audience members were scrambling to leave.

12
00:00:38.855 --> 00:00:40.717
Roxy held up her arms.

13
00:00:40.718 --> 00:00:45.319
"Everyone, please stay calm! We need to leave in a safe . . ."

14
00:00:45.320 --> 00:00:48.257
Suddenly a portal opened up in the middle of the arena.

15
00:00:48.258 --> 00:00:52.900
Roxy gasped as the Battle Master stumbled through it, and Bippo appeared.

16
00:00:52.901 --> 00:00:55.338
Everyone stopped running and arguing.

17
00:00:55.339 --> 00:00:58.478
Roxy scratched her head. "What just happened?"

18
00:00:58.479 --> 00:01:01.827
Terrell smiled. "Bippo has a portal projector.

19
00:01:01.828 --> 00:01:04.568
He must have followed Plurf and brought him back!"

20
00:01:04.569 --> 00:01:08.484
Bippo flew over. "Sneaky, me!"

21
00:01:08.485 --> 00:01:13.896
Plurf stood up and looked at all the angry faces.

22
00:01:13.897 --> 00:01:17.723
"I—I was, um, just kidding!

23
00:01:17.724 --> 00:01:21.174
This place isn't going to blow up!"

24
00:01:21.175 --> 00:01:25.704
He laughed nervously. "We're all safe!"

25
00:01:25.705 --> 00:01:28.542
Slowly the audience began to stomp and chant.

26
00:01:28.543 --> 00:01:32.779
"Give our money back! Give our money back!"

27
00:01:32.780 --> 00:01:37.451
"I d-don't have your money anymore," Plurf said.

28
00:01:37.452 --> 00:01:42.111
"But if you give me some time, maybe I can, um . . ."

29
00:01:42.112 --> 00:01:46.109
"Give our money back! Give our money back!"

30
00:01:46.110 --> 00:01:51.230
Cozlin looked at Roxy. "I think this is a pretty good punishment, right?"

31
00:01:51.231 --> 00:01:57.011
Roxy nodded. "Let's get out of here."

32
00:01:57.012 --> 00:02:00.185
"Yes, Mom," Roxy said. "We're all safe.

33
00:02:00.186 --> 00:02:02.435
Terrell and I will be home soon."

34
00:02:02.436 --> 00:02:04.383
Everyone was in Dr. Odd's moon.

35
00:02:04.384 --> 00:02:09.060
He, Cozlin, Terrell, and Wukong drank tea while Sapphire slept.

36
00:02:09.061 --> 00:02:13.907
As Roxy closed her watch, light sparkled and Guanyin appeared.

37
00:02:13.908 --> 00:02:16.624
Wukong bowed. "Hey, Bodhisattva!

38
00:02:16.625 --> 00:02:19.096
I was just about to return to the Tang Monk.

39
00:02:19.097 --> 00:02:21.322
I'm sure he misses me!"

40
00:02:21.323 --> 00:02:25.504
Guanyin smiled. "I will take you there now, Wukong."

41
00:02:25.505 --> 00:02:30.819
She turned to Sapphire. "Dragon, wake up!"

42
00:02:30.820 --> 00:02:33.095
Sapphire's eyes popped open.

43
00:02:33.096 --> 00:02:37.234
Right away, the dragon lowered her head. "Bodhisattva."

44
00:02:37.235 --> 00:02:41.677
"You performed your task well for many years," Guanyin said.

45
00:02:41.678 --> 00:02:44.976
"Buddha is pleased, so your punishment is over.

46
00:02:44.977 --> 00:02:48.169
You may now live in the Western Paradise with him."

47
00:02:48.170 --> 00:02:52.108
Sapphire nodded. "Thank you."

48
00:02:52.109 --> 00:02:54.033
Wukong looked at his friends.

49
00:02:54.034 --> 00:02:57.916
"Well, I guess this is good-bye—again."

50
00:02:57.917 --> 00:03:02.640
Roxy chuckled. "I'm sure we'll see each other sometime."

51
00:03:02.641 --> 00:03:09.462
Everyone said good-bye, and then Wukong, Guanyin, and Sapphire vanished.

52
00:03:09.463 --> 00:03:13.307
Dr. Odd sat down at his computer. "Let's go home."

53
00:03:13.308 --> 00:03:20.038
Cozlin sighed. "Yes. I have a big mess to clean up on Delkor."

54
00:03:20.039 --> 00:03:21.555
Terrell looked concerned.

55
00:03:21.556 --> 00:03:24.449
"Why don't we come with you? We can help."

56
00:03:24.450 --> 00:03:26.696
He looked around. "Right?"

57
00:03:26.697 --> 00:03:29.154
Dr. Odd nodded. "Of course.

58
00:03:29.155 --> 00:03:32.917
I'll be happy to visit Delkor and help with the cleanup."

59
00:03:32.918 --> 00:03:35.314
Cozlin looked at Roxy and frowned.

60
00:03:35.315 --> 00:03:40.762
"No, thanks. I caused a lot of trouble—I should fix it myself."

61
00:03:40.763 --> 00:03:43.838
Roxy put her arm around Cozlin's shoulders.

62
00:03:43.839 --> 00:03:49.402
"Kid Comet, do you really think we're going to make you clean up that mess by yourself?"

63
00:03:49.403 --> 00:03:52.703
Cozlin blinked. "You'll help me?"

64
00:03:52.704 --> 00:04:01.710
Roxy laughed. "Of course we'll help you. We're the Galaxy Squad!"

